WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.494
(calm music)

00:00:01.494 --> 00:00:04.161
(pen scratches)

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.940
- My name is Charlie
and I'm nine years old.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.850
- And my name is Jake
and I'm seven years old.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.020
- I really want a perm

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.970
because all the girls
would think I'm handsome.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.593
I'd also want a lot of money.

00:00:17.593 --> 00:00:19.110
- I really want Robux, lots of them,

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.810
because I could buy cool
stuff on my Roblox account.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.960
- If I get my perm, I
promise to comb it every day,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.400
to make sure it looks nice.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.890
If I get money, I will buy hair products

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.850
to make sure my perm looks
its very best every day.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.458
That's all for now.

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:36.524
(air swooshes)
(many people laugh)

00:00:36.524 --> 00:00:38.325
(audience applauds)

00:00:38.325 --> 00:00:41.658
- It's literally my favorite thing, ever

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:45.030
that this kid asked for a perm.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.730
How ridiculously cute is that?

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.555
- That is my favorite
thing I've ever seen.

00:00:50.555 --> 00:00:51.726
(Jewel laughs)

00:00:51.726 --> 00:00:52.757
(many people laugh)
- That was very cute.

00:00:52.757 --> 00:00:54.810
- I love that so much.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:58.620
- It's, like, you just don't
see it coming and it does.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.180
Well, welcome back everybody.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.190
Jewel and Andrea Savage are with us,

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:05.370
hanging out.
(audience applauds)

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.710
And, all week we have teamed up

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.140
with our season-long
partner, Pilot FriXion Pen,

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.930
the go-to, erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.270
We are taking a little
pressure off old Saint Nick

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:18.360
and helping answer some
hand-written letters to Santa.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:22.350
Charlie and Jake, we want
to celebrate kids like you,

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:25.110
creating fearless and
bold holiday letters,

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.250
and just being awesome.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.083
I love you.

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:30.059
So, we're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:30.892
(audience applauds)
Charlie,

00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:32.832
you go and get that perm

00:01:32.832 --> 00:01:35.130
(laughs) and all the
hair products you desire,

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:38.250
and Jake, you'll be all set with Roblox.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.550
My kids love that too.
Merry Christmas, y'all.

